title Vinyl P2a: the sleep timer running (30 minutes chosen 48 s ago: "Stops in 29:12", the music fading over the last 10 s), the Sleep timer page with its status line and the Menu with the time left (640x480 (9.01 px/mm))
sizes 640x480
ppmm 901
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_PAGE sleep
env VINYL_DEMO_SLEEP 30
env VINYL_DEMO_SLEEP_LEFT 1753

wait 900
shot 01-sleep-running
expect text "30 minutes"
expect text "STOP PLAYING AFTER"
key left
wait 400
shot 02-menu-running
expect text "Sleep timer"
key left
wait 400
shot 03-now-running
expect noquit
